 Running a microservices app (frontend + backend + database)?

𝐖𝐢𝐭𝐡𝐨𝐮𝐭 𝐎𝐓𝐞𝐥 → Each vendor requires its own agent, creating complexity.
𝐖𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐎𝐓𝐞𝐥 → Instrument once, choose your backend later (Prometheus for metrics, Jaeger for traces, Elasticsearch for logs).


👉 In short: OpenTelemetry = one framework, endless observability possibilities.
